                    <i data-lucide="git-branch" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600"></i>
                    5. Workflow Status & Attachment
                </h3>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <label asp-for="Status" class="block text-slate-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-1 font-bold">STATUS</label>
